        "text_Na7qeK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>🐾 Welcome to the Snarky Pet Community! At Snarky Pets, we believe pets aren't just animals — they're family, best friends, and full-blown weirdos (just like us!). Our community is a place for proud pet parents to share laughs, life hacks, and everyday fur-baby chaos.📸 </p><p><strong>Share Your Snark!</strong></p><p>We LOVE seeing your pets being their quirky, goofy, and snuggly selves. </p><p>Tag us on TikTok or Instagram @SnarkyPets and use #SnarkyFurFam to be featured on our site or social media!💬 </p><p>Connect with Other Pet PeopleFrom crate-training fails to spa day wins, our pet community is all about! 🎉 </p><p>Join the PackStay snarky. Stay spoiled. Stay in the loop.Your pet is already a star — we’re just here to make it official. 🐾</p><p>Snarky Pet: Where sass meets snuggles.<br/><br/></p>"
